<view class="page-shell cart-page">
  <view wx:if="{{cart.length}}">
    <view class="cart-header row-between"><view><view class="section-title">购物车</view><view class="muted-text">共 {{cartCount}} 件 · 不同履约将分开处理</view></view><view class="clear-cart" bindtap="clearCart">清空</view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:for-item="group" wx:key="type" class="cart-group"><view class="cart-group-head"><view class="cart-group-icon"><image class="ui-icon" src="/images/theme/{{group.icon}}.svg" /></view><view class="cart-group-copy"><view class="cart-group-title">{{group.title}}</view><view class="cart-group-subtitle">{{group.subtitle}}</view></view><view class="cart-group-total">¥{{group.goodsText}}</view></view><view class="cart-list"><view wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:for-item="item" wx:key="cartKey" class="cart-item"><view class="food-emoji cart-emoji" style="background: {{item.color}};"><image wx:if="{{item.coverImageUrl}}" class="food-photo" mode="aspectFill" src="{{item.coverImageUrl}}" /><image wx:else class="ui-icon ui-icon--large" src="/images/theme/{{group.type === 'COURIER' ? 'snack' : 'bowl'}}.svg" /></view><view class="cart-item-main"><view class="cart-item-title">{{item.name}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.optionsText}}" class="cart-options">{{item.optionsText}}</view><view class="cart-item-bottom"><text class="price">{{item.unitPriceText}}</text><view class="quantity-control"><view class="quantity-button" data-key="{{item.cartKey}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="changeQuantity">−</view><view class="quantity-number">{{item.quantity}}</view><view class="quantity-button quantity-button--plus" data-key="{{item.cartKey}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="changeQuantity">+</view></view></view></view></view></view><view class="cart-group-foot">商品小计 <text>¥{{group.goodsText}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="cart-note"><image class="ui-icon ui-icon--small" src="/images/theme/check.svg" /><view>餐饮配送需要配送地址；零售商品需要快递地址。优惠券将在结算页按适用范围选择。</view></view>
    <view class="price-summary"><view class="summary-row"><text>商品小计</text><text>¥{{goodsAmountText}}</text></view><view class="summary-row summary-total"><text>预计合计</text><text>¥{{totalText}}</text></view><view class="summary-note">运费 / 配送费会在结算页分别核算</view></view>
    <view class="bottom-space"></view><view class="checkout-bar"><view><view class="checkout-total-label">商品合计 <text>¥{{totalText}}</text></view><view class="checkout-tip">不同业务会生成关联订单</view></view><button class="primary-button checkout-button" bindtap="goCheckout">去结算</button></view>
  </view>
  <view wx:else class="empty-state"><image class="empty-brand" src="/images/theme/rabbit-pair.svg" mode="aspectFit" /><view class="empty-title">购物车还是空的</view><view class="empty-desc">二两烟火，等你来挑一份喜欢</view><button class="primary-button empty-button" bindtap="goHome">去点餐</button></view>
</view>
